{"id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat.md","title":"Boolean Satisfiability Language","display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","aliases":["73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","73-df-boolean-satisfiability"],"display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</span><span>73-df-boolean-satisfiability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> (countable propositional-variable set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary coding alphabet; word operations are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\top,\\neg,\\,\\wedge,\\,\\vee\">\\(\\bot,\\top,\\neg,\\,\\wedge,\\,\\vee\\)</span> (pairwise disjoint injective formal constructors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\">\\(\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\\)</span> (canonical prefix-coding package)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (truth assignment)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;\n((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;\n((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\n\\land\\forall S\\;\n(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\n\\land\\forall S\\;\n(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\forall\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_\\nu=0\n\\land\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket_\\nu=1\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\;\n\\llbracket p\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\nu(p)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\llbracket\\neg\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=1-\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\\bigl(\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=\\min(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu)\n\\land\\llbracket\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=\\max(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\forall\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\}\n\\land\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_\\nu=0\n\\land\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket_\\nu=1\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\;\n\\llbracket p\\rrbracket_\\nu=\\nu(p)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\llbracket\\neg\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=1-\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\\bigl(\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=\\min(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu)\n\\land\\llbracket\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\n=\\max(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\n\\land\\operatorname{bcode}:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{bdecode}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{bcode})\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{bdecode}\\circ\\operatorname{bcode}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{bcode}(\\bot)=000\n\\land\\operatorname{bcode}(\\top)=001\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\operatorname{bcode}(p_i)=01\\,1^i0\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\operatorname{bcode}(\\neg\\varphi)=10\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\n=110\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{bcode}(\\psi)\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\land\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\n=111\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{bcode}(\\psi)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\n\\land\\operatorname{bcode}:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf 2^*\n\\land\\operatorname{bdecode}:\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{bcode})\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{bdecode}\\circ\\operatorname{bcode}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land \\operatorname{bcode}(\\bot)=000\n\\land\\operatorname{bcode}(\\top)=001\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\operatorname{bcode}(p_i)=01\\,1^i0\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\operatorname{bcode}(\\neg\\varphi)=10\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\\\\n{}\\land \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\n=110\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{bcode}(\\psi)\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\land\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\n=111\\,\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{bcode}(\\psi)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\n(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu=1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\n(\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu=1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion gives a unique truth-value map for every assignment.</li>\n<li>The tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"000,001,01,10,110,111\">\\(000,001,01,10,110,111\\)</span> are prefix-separated at constructor boundaries; the unary terminator in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"01\\,1^i0\">\\(01\\,1^i0\\)</span> makes variable indices self-delimiting. Recursive descent therefore encodes and decodes in time linear in the displayed code length, so the coding cannot hide a superpolynomial change of representation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-an